Rules that hold across every version

· Nautilus. One chamber at a time. No version adds more than it can settle.
· Offline. No network capability until layer 33 is real.
· Visible mechanism. Nothing hidden, nothing pretending.
· Nessy is a symbol. She reflects the council. She does not reason.
· Conversation is the interface. The council speaks; it does not display.
· Grounded words, surreal frame, care for the visitor.

