Open questions blocking v3

· Lumen's target. Settled by the Wiki Tree doc: follows connections to people. Built from composite signs (focus, recent touch, session length, returning), not one raw input. Confirm before code.
· Weights persistence. The council learns during a session and forgets on close. Saving W1/B1/W2/B2 to a file is small enough for v3. Confirm whether it lands now or in v4.
· Numbering collision. The Nessy architecture README has its own v1–v7 axis. This roadmap is the app's build axis. Needs one line resolving which is which.

